!**/.mvn/
!**/.mvn/**
!**/.github/
!**/.github/**
!**/.openai/
!**/.openai/**

# Generated output and dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/target/

# OS metadata
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
